    "Needed to run Nuri. This is health information, kept private and never sold or used to target ads. Export or delete it anytime." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Needed to run Nuri. This is health information, kept private and never sold or used to target ads. Export or delete it anytime."
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "누리를 사용하려면 필요해요. 건강 정보이므로 비공개로 보관하며 판매하거나 맞춤 광고에 사용하지 않아요. 언제든 내보내거나 삭제할 수 있어요."
